tein"},"statements":[{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Isolate\nCut carefully along dotted line"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"HIGH QUALITY PROTEIN SOURCE FOR ADVANCED NUTRITION"},{"type":"Formula re: Type","notes":"A GREAT CHOICE FOR ATHLETES OR THOSE ON HIGH PROTEIN DIETS"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"HIGH IN BCAAs"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"INSTANTIZED FOR EASY MIXING"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"98% LACTOSE FREE"},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"ASPARTAME-FREE"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"MICROFILTERED FOR FASTER ABSORPTION AND DELIVERY"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"PROTEIN POWDER"},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"NOTICE: Use this product as a food supplement only. Do not use for weight reduction."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Naturally flavored"},{"type":"Formula re: Type","notes":"Whey is popular with bodybuilders, people on high protein diets, and anyone looking for a quick, easy-to-use nutritional drink. Our Whey Isolate Powder is specifically designed for anyone looking for high quality nutrition to support their workout and fitness goals."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Whey is derived from milk and is loaded with strength-building protein, which plays a role in optimal nutrition.* Whey Isolate contains Branched Chain Amino Acids – made up of Leucine, Isoleucine and Valine which are important components of muscle tissue.*"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Whey Isolate is designed for those looking for an advanced nutritional drink. Isolated Whey results in less of the fat and lactose that you don’t need."},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"For an extra treat, blend with fruit or your favorite non-fat frozen yogurt."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Precision Engineered has pioneered the manufacture of premium sports nutrition supplements. Our commitment to quality is the highest in our industry. Every product undergoes rigorous analysis for purity, potency, safety and freshness. We guarantee it!"},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"QA Quality Assured"},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"No Artificial Color, No Artificial Flavor, No Preservatives, No Gluten, No Wheat, No Yeast, No Fish."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Typical Amino Acid Profile Per 37 g Serving:\nL-Alanine 1,454 mg\nL-Arginine 632 mg\nL-Aspartic Acid 3,269 mg\nL-Cystine 739 mg\nGlutamic Acid 5,197 mg\nL-Glycine 485 mg\n1L-Histidine 557 mg\n1L-Isoleucine 1,963 mg\n1L-Leucine 3,056 mg\n1L-Lysine 2,391 mg\n1L-Methionine 601 mg\n1L-Phenylalanine 864 mg\nL-Proline 2,130 mg\nL-Serine 1,459 mg\n1L-Threonine 2,182 mg\n1L-Tryptophan*** 519 mg\nL-Tyrosine 884 mg\n1L-Valine 1,735 mg\n***L-Tryptophan is naturally occurring, not added.\n1Essential Amino Acids\nTypical Amino Acid Profile Per 74 g Serving:\nL-Alanine 2,909 mg\nL-Arginine 1,265 mg\nL-Aspartic Acid 6,539 mg\nL-Cystine 1,478 mg\nGlutamic Acid 10,395 mg\nL-Glycine 970 mg\n1L-Histidine 1,114 mg\n1L-Isoleucine 3,927 mg\n1L-Leucine 6,112 mg\n1L-Lysine 4,783 mg\n1L-Methionine 1,203 mg\n1L-Phenylalanine 1,728 mg\nL-Proline 4,260 mg\nL-Serine 2,919 mg\n1L-Threonine 4,364 mg\n1L-Tryptophan*** 1,039 mg\nL-Tyrosine 1,768 mg\n1L-Valine 3,470 mg\n***L-Tryptophan is naturally occurring, not added.\n1Essential Amino Acids"},{"type":"Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications","notes":"WARNING: If you are pregnant, nursing, taking any medications or have any medical condition, consult your doctor before use."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Discontinue use and consult your doctor if any adverse reactions occur."},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"Keep out of reach of children."},{"type":"Storage","notes":"Store at room temperature."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Do not use if package is torn or open."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Contents are sold by weight. Some settling may occur."},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"*Use in conjunction with an intense daily exercise program and a balanced diet including an adequate caloric intake."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"2016 Precision Engineered Limited (USA)"},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"DIRECTIONS: For adults, add one (1) scoop (37 g) to 8 fluid ounces of water or your favorite beverage. Mix in your Precision Engineered shaker or a blender and drink immediately for best results. You can drink Precision Engineered Whey Protein any time during the day to add extra high quality protein to your daily calorie intake. Be sure to figure the extra calories provided by milk, juice or whatever you may add to your Precision Engineered Whey Protein. Increase or decrease the amount of liquid added to achieve desired consistency."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Servings Per Container about 61 about 31"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Calories 2,000 Calories 2,500\nTotal Fat Less than 65g 80g\nSat Fat Less than 20g 25g\nCholesterol Less than 300mg 300mg\nSodium Less than 2,400mg 2,400mg\nPotassium 3,500mg 3,500mg\nTotal Carbohydrate 300g 375g\nDietary Fiber 25g 30g\t\nProtein 50g 65g \nCalories per gram: Fat 9 ~ Carbohydrate 4 ~ Protein 4\n"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Contains milk and soy ingredients."},{"type":"Precautions re: Allergies","notes":"Contains milk and soy ingredients."},{"type":"General: Product/Version Code","notes":"Prod. # 31471 B55641 08B"}],"claims":[{"langualCode":"P0065","langualCodeDescription":"Nutrient "},{"langualCode":"P0115","langualCodeDescription":"All Other"}],"events":[{"date":"2016-12-23","type":"Date entered into DSLD"}],"userGroups":[{"dailyVa